{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vimeo/psalm/issues/1375","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vimeo/psalm","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vimeo/psalm/issues/1375/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vimeo/psalm/issues/1375/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vimeo/psalm/issues/1375/events","html_url":"https://github.com/vimeo/psalm/issues/1375","id":412694370,"node_id":"MDU6SXNzdWU0MTI2OTQzNzA=","number":1375,"title":"define() ignores namespaces","user":{"login":"bugreportuser","id":37939393,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3OTM5Mzkz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/37939393?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bugreportuser","html_url":"https://github.com/bugreportuser","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bugreportuser/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bugreportuser/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bugreportuser/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bugreportuser/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bugreportuser/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bugreportuser/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bugreportuser/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bugreportuser/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bugreportuser/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":486061586,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw0ODYwNjE1ODY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vimeo/psalm/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ee0701","default":true,"description":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2019-02-21T00:35:09Z","updated_at":"2019-02-21T23:19:18Z","closed_at":"2019-02-21T23:19:18Z","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Issue for https://github.com/vimeo/psalm/pull/1358.\r\n\r\nPsalm ignores namespaces for `define()`. Removing the namespace was done in https://github.com/vimeo/psalm/pull/1358/files#diff-8d161e8eca0edad572c2b6d0818a4bc2R1486, but lookup needs to be changed before that code can be removed.\r\n\r\nAll these `echo` lines should cause errors (https://getpsalm.org/r/2f026abf41):\r\n```php\r\n<?php\r\nnamespace {\r\ndefine('ns1\\\\cons1', 0);\r\n}\r\nnamespace ns1 {\r\ndefine(__NAMESPACE__.'\\\\cons2', 0);\r\n\r\necho \\ns2\\cons1;\r\necho ns2\\cons1;\r\necho ns1\\cons1;\r\n\r\necho \\ns2\\cons2;\r\necho ns2\\cons2;\r\necho ns1\\cons2;\r\n}\r\nnamespace ns2 {\r\necho \\ns2\\cons1;\r\necho ns1\\cons1;\r\n}\r\nnamespace {\r\necho \\ns2\\cons1;\r\necho ns2\\cons1;\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nOutput:\r\n```\r\nPsalm output (using commit 1e2c290):\r\n\r\nNo issues!\r\n```","closed_by":{"login":"muglug","id":2292638,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyOTI2Mzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2292638?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug","html_url":"https://github.com/muglug","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vimeo/psalm/issues/1375/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vimeo/psalm/issues/1375/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}